        147.14138793945312
      ],
      "text": "Executive summary",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 25.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.419921875,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV are about 14 times more likely to develop TB disease, have poorer treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.3958740234375,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "outcomes and more than two-fold higher mortality during TB treatment, compared to all people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4291381835938,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed with TB  . Addressing HIV-associated TB through integrated patient-centred care and  (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        361.9346008300781,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "prevention is a key component of the WHO  . End TB strategy (3)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4124145507812,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "For several decades, WHO has developed and issued recommendations on screening, diagnosis,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.3970947265625,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "treatment, care and prevention of HIV-associated TB. To support countries to reduce the burden of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4370727539062,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "HIV-associated TB in populations at risk of or affected by both diseases, WHO published an  Interim",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        527.4050903320312,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "in 2004, which was updated in 2012  . The TB/HIV policy  policy on collaborative TB/HIV activities  (9, 10)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        524.3995361328125,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "has served as a vehicle for a robust global response, advocating for further investment and scale-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.3870849609375,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "up of collaborative TB/HIV activities, and has provided guidance to Member States and partners on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4398193359375,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "effectively addressing HIV-associated TB. It is estimated that scale-up of these interventions between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4339599609375,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "2005–2022 has saved 9.2 million lives  . Yet, despite impressive scale-up of collaborative TB/HIV  (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4178466796875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "activities and the advances in the prevention, diagnosis and treatment of TB disease, TB remains",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.3936767578125,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the leading cause of death among people living with HIV worldwide and gaps still remain in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4091796875,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "implementation of TB/HIV collaborative activities. Since 2012, several recommendations have been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        454.711181640625,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "updated and additional recommendations formulated as the evidence has evolved.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4246826171875,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The guidance provided in this section of the   (hereafter  WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4189453125,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "referred to as the TB/HIV guidelines) outlines specific WHO recommendations on screening,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        364.9093017578125,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis, treatment, care and prevention of HIV-associated TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.385986328125,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The TB/HIV guidelines contain a set of 31 recommendations on HIV-associated TB, which have been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4200439453125,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "consolidated from WHO guidelines on TB and on HIV, as summarized below. The recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4404296875,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "are accompanied by operational guidance and implementation considerations in the  WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        450.7356872558594,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": ".  operational handbook on tuberculosis. Module 6: tuberculosis and comorbidities (7)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
