      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.3978271484375,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "These consolidated guidelines summarize the rationale and evidence behind all WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.3981323242188,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "recommendations that address HIV-associated TB for adults living with HIV although some",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.420654296875,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "recommendations will also be relevant for children and adolescents.  Recommendations specifically",
